      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the requested file, I need to choose a concrete external provider for a managed logging service. AWS CloudWatch is a popular choice for managed logging services. I will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with CloudWatch. The code will import Boto3, use the CloudWatch client, and include a concrete log group name to identify the provider. </thinking>\n",
